From 790b03917f647ffb4627a47f7f823f44328c01d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Konstantin Klubnichkin <kitsok@yandex-team.ru>
Date: Tue, 13 Dec 2022 11:49:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make failsafe dependant on power state and config

Introduce new configuration parameter for temperature sensors:
"failsafeCritical": true/false (default: false)
When set to true and missing when host power is on - go to failsafe mode.
Otherwise stay in normal mode as most of the sensors may disappear when power is off.
Currently only CPU temperature sensors are critical.

onPowerOn controller property

Introduce onPowerOn controller property that causes controller
to be processed when host is powered off.
Only controller now is for DCDC that works all the time.
Default value is false.

